	"Consumers": [],
	"Description": "Changes to individual Okta accounts: MFA factors reset or deactivated, users created, lockouts, and users reporting suspicious activity. Usually routed to the identity / helpdesk team.\n\nNo consumers are attached. Next step after install: add a consumer flow to this alert (email, Slack, Teams, webhook, Jira, ...) to route it where your team works. Alert events are also written to the shared _alerts tag (Contents._vendor is Okta), so you can search them without a consumer. Each producer is a scheduled search; disable a producer to turn off one detection without turning off the alert.",
